  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.1:\n\t\t\t- Fixes an assembly metadata misalignment and build caching issue from v2.2.0. \n\t\t\tEffectively exposes all new features, including the optional 'downscale' parameter in DrawOnConsole.\n\n\n\t\t\tv2.2.0:\n\t\t\t- Added downscale support (50% reduction) for all fonts.\n\t\t\t- Redesigned Turing and Shaded fonts using solid blocks for better visual consistency.\n\t\t\t- Resolved multiple internal exceptions and improved error handling during matrix generation.\n\t\t\tv2.1.0:\n\t\t\t- UI-agnostic engine\n\t\t\t- TrueType font introduction.",
